{{!--
	A Curse's blight, while the Company still carries it (p14), drawn from
	timeContext's offCourse: what it has done to their way, and the two things
	the Referee can do about it. Drawn on the GM Toolkit's Time page, which
	keeps its own heading above this.
--}}
<p class="bastionland-hint">{{line}}</p>
<nav class="bastionland-toolbar" aria-label="{{localize 'bastionland.realm.landmarks.offCourse.title'}}">
	<button type="button" data-action="travellingBlind" data-tooltip="{{localize 'bastionland.realm.landmarks.offCourse.rollHint'}}"><i class="fa-solid fa-eye-low-vision" inert></i> {{localize "bastionland.realm.landmarks.offCourse.roll"}}</button>
	<button type="button" data-action="holdCourse" data-tooltip="{{localize 'bastionland.realm.landmarks.offCourse.holdHint'}}"><i class="fa-solid fa-xmark" inert></i> {{localize "bastionland.realm.landmarks.offCourse.hold"}}</button>
</nav>
